    "rad": {
      "array": "eeq_rad",
      "file": "raw/multicharge/src/multicharge/param/eeq2019.f90",
      "lines": "132-153",
      "units": "bohr",
      "meaning": "charge width; enters the diagonal as sqrt(2/pi)/rad and the off-diagonal as gamma_ij = 1/(rad_i^2+rad_j^2). These radii are static: no charge or CN scaling is applied in the kernel."
